- 手感：Balatro https://blakecrosley.com/zh-Hant/guides/design/balatro 、https://80.lv/articles/balatro-s-card-movements-shaders-recreated-in-unity 、微互動時間 https://playbooks.com/skills/dylantarre/animation-principles/micro-interactions
- 遊戲字體與版面：https://indieklem.substack.com/p/13-the-basics-of-typography-in-game 、https://www.gamedeveloper.com/design/down-to-the-letter-the-importance-of-typography-in-video-games 、https://bugnet.io/blog/ui-design-basics-for-indie-developers 、https://wayline.io/blog/less-is-more-why-negative-space-wins-in-game-design
- 參考作品：WARTILE https://80.lv/articles/wartile-illusion-of-tabletop-gaming 、Slay the Spire https://www.greenmangaming.com/blog/how-slay-the-spire-became-the-gold-standard-for-all-card-battler-games/ 、Cult of the Lamb https://unity.com/en/blog/games/recipe-behind-smash-hit-cult-of-the-lamb 、Kingdom Rush https://www.gamedeveloper.com/design/kingdom-rush---the-wonderful-campaign-level-design 、Super Auto Pets https://superautopets.wiki.gg/wiki/Version_0.28 、Bad North https://kakuchopurei.com/2018/11/07/bad-north-a-minimalist-real-time-tactics-strategy-game-thats-easy-on-the-eyes/
- 聲音：分層 https://kindatechnical.com/game-development/sound-effects-foley-synthesis-and-layering.html 、https://www.krotosaudio.com/foley-teacher-hollow-knight-sound-effects-reformer-pro/ 、Sonniss https://gamefromscratch.com/sonniss-27-5gb-sound-effect-giveaway-at-gdc-2024/ 、作曲行情 https://www.twine.net/blog/video-game-music-cost-guide/ 、https://orphiq.com/resources/video-game-music-composers
- 商店頁：https://www.strayspark.studio/blog/steam-capsule-art-store-page-conversion-guide-2026 、https://www.summerengine.com/ja/make-great-games/market-your-indie-game
# V1.2.0 方案裁決紀錄（三方三輪）
- r1：Antigravity 列電腦感前 8 名＋字級樣式表＋8 色色票；Codex 列字型管線、直接畫字（LabelSettings 不生效）、九宮格可沿用 draw_style_box、ducking 沒接上、15～25 人日。
- 裁決：字體、色票、文字樣式、九宮格升到 P0，排在轉場前面（Antigravity：醜框加彈簧＝會彈的網頁表單）。
- r2：字體兩方都選方案甲（ThenKhung＋源泉圓體＋Fredoka）；隊色兩方都說不改；Antigravity 修正光影為頂亮底暗（翻面不穿幫）、走勢圖保留但改墨線、外包先 4 兵試點且維持 Q 版；Codex：字型預算 2～3.5 MiB、三頁重排 9～13 日、M1 32～46 人日、隊色若改相對亮度 0.38→0.18。
- r3（兩方有條件同意，全部採納）：源泉圓體字重 R／B（不是 M／B）；介面藍紅明度要拉開到對比 ≥3:1；小兵不疊紙紋、圖集不加通道；M1 先鎖立繪佔位規格；ThenKhung 依文字角色、不依字級；1/4 em 只加在中英交界；地圖底紋歸 M2；改 Ogg 要同步改載入；補 M1 驗收門檻與實作順序。
- Ruling：不採芫荽、霞鶩文楷、Lilita One（小字可讀性與多一組基線）— 代價：內文少一點手寫溫度。
- Ruling：不做戰場逐格精靈圖、不做執行時線條微抖 — 代價：戰場小兵仍是程式繪製（靠 D1 烘焙質感補）。

