lbd_t_budget,金幣上限,Gold
lbd_budget,每一邊可以花的錢。錢多兵多，戰鬥比較久、比較亂；錢少就只能精挑細選。標準是 100 金。,"How much each side can spend. More gold means bigger, longer, messier fights; less gold means every pick matters. Standard is 100."
lbd_t_handicap,讓子,Handicap
lbd_handicap,兩邊金幣不同，給新手或熟手一點差距。勝負改用「剩下的戰力占自己金幣的比例」來比，金幣少的一方不吃虧。,"Give the sides different gold. Results compare remaining power as a share of each side's own gold, so the smaller army isn't penalised."
lbd_t_budget_red,紅方金幣,Red gold
lbd_budget_red,讓子時紅方可以花的錢。,Red's gold when handicap is on.
lbd_t_unit_cap,人數上限,Unit cap
lbd_unit_cap,一邊最多擺幾隻。人越多畫面越擠、戰鬥越久；最多 40 隻。,Most units per side. More units means a busier screen and longer fights; up to 40.
lbd_t_type_cap,單種上限,Per-type cap
lbd_type_cap,同一種兵最多幾隻。設低一點會逼你混編；太低時錢可能花不完，下面會提醒。,Most of any one unit. A low cap forces mixed armies; if it's too low some gold can go unused (shown below).
lbd_t_ticks,一局時間,Match length
lbd_ticks,戰鬥最長幾秒；時間到比剩下的戰力。狂熱會照比例提早或延後（一局的三分之二開始）。,Longest a fight can last; at time-out remaining power decides. Frenzy starts at two-thirds of the match.
lbd_t_rounds,局數,Rounds
lbd_rounds,幾局決勝負。平手不算勝場；打到上限還沒分出來就比勝場。,"How many games decide the series. Draws don't count; if the cap is reached, most wins takes it."
lbd_t_place_rule,落子方式,Deployment order
lbd_place_rule,輪流落子：每人輪流擺、擺下不能收回，輪序公平。同時暗擺：各自擺好再一起翻開。,"Alternating: take turns placing, no take-backs, with a fair turn order. Blind: both place in secret, then reveal."
lbd_t_turns,每人手數,Turns each
lbd_turns,自訂落子時每人輪幾手；每手的金額＝金幣上限÷手數。,Turns per player for custom alternating deployment; each turn's gold is total gold ÷ turns.
lbd_t_carry,剩錢累積,Carry-over
lbd_carry,沒花完的錢留到下一手。可以先省後花，但對手也看得到你省了多少。,"Unspent gold rolls over to your next turn. Save now, spend later — your opponent can see it too."
lbd_t_ai_level,AI 難度,AI difficulty
lbd_ai_level,簡單：隨意擺。普通：照常見陣型擺。困難：會讀你上一局的陣型來反制。,Easy: places loosely. Normal: uses common formations. Hard: reads your last formation and counters it.
lbd_t_keep,保留陣型,Keep formation
lbd_keep,下一局一開始就是你上一局的陣型，只要微調。,Start each new round with your previous formation.
lbd_t_ai_pool_same,AI 卡池,AI pool
lbd_ai_pool_same,關掉後可以在卡池分頁另外設定 AI 能用的兵。,Turn off to give the AI its own pool on the Unit pool tab.
lbd_t_pool,卡池,Unit pool
lbd_pool,這局能用哪些兵，最多 10 種。至少要有 1 種戰鬥兵；支援兵和奇襲兵（孢子菇、爆爆羊、寶箱怪）都不算。,"Which units can be used, up to 10 types. At least one fighter type is required; support units and raiders (Sporecap, Boom Sheep, Mimic) do not count."
lbd_t_lab,沙盒,Sandbox
lbd_lab,把兵種的血量、攻擊、速度調成 50%～200%，或關掉技能。沙盒局不記戰績也不給成就。,"Scale a unit's health, attack and speed from 50% to 200%, or turn skills off. Sandbox games don't count for stats or achievements."
lb_pinfo_standard,推薦的玩法：王國軍 10 種、100 金、三戰兩勝。數值經過完整驗收。,"The recommended setup: 10 Kingdom units, 100 gold, best of 3. Fully balance-tested."
lb_pinfo_classic5,只用最早的 5 種兵。規則最單純，雙人對戰唯一驗證過先後手公平的組合。,"Only the first five units. The simplest game, and the only setup verified fair for two players."
lb_pinfo_small,錢少、時間短，每一隻都要想清楚，一局一分鐘內結束。,Little gold and a short clock: every unit counts and a game is over in under a minute.
lb_pinfo_big,180 金、最多 40 隻、120 秒。場面最熱鬧，戰鬥也最久。,"180 gold, up to 40 units, 120 seconds. The biggest, longest battles."
lb_pinfo_single,只開一種戰鬥兵（可以再加一種支援兵），比的純粹是站位。到卡池分頁換兵種。,One fighter type (plus one support if you like): pure positioning. Change the type on the Unit pool tab.
lb_pinfo_custom,自訂規則。右邊列出和標準不同的地方。,Custom rules. The differences from standard are listed on the right.
