mom_caption,戰力走勢：中線以上＝藍方占優，以下＝紅方占優,"Momentum: above the line = Blue ahead, below = Red ahead"
series_now,第 %d 局結束　藍 %d：%d 紅（先拿 %d 勝）,Round %d done — Blue %d : %d Red (first to %d)
