rv_you_free,你的陣型（點兵修改）,Yours (tap a unit)
rv_enemy,對手站位（參考）,Opponent (reference)
codex_story_h,── 介紹 ──,── About ──
set_tab_0,畫面,Display
set_tab_1,聲音,Sound
set_tab_2,操作,Gameplay
set_tab_3,輔助,Accessibility
set_plain_titles,標題用一般字型,Plain title font
set_confirm,雙人落子要點兩下,Tap twice to place (duel)
sd_set_lang,介面語言。,Interface language.
sd_set_text,文字大小：100%、125%、150%。標題放大得少、內文放大得多，版面不會被撐爆。,"Text size: 100%, 125% or 150%. Body text grows more than headings so screens stay tidy."
sd_set_plain_titles,標題改用一般的黑體字（預設是毛筆風格的標題字）。,Use the plain sans font for headings instead of the brush-style title font.
sd_set_fullscreen,全螢幕或視窗。,Fullscreen or windowed.
sd_set_music,背景音樂音量。,Background music volume.
sd_set_sfx,音效音量。,Sound effects volume.
sd_set_speed,戰鬥開始時的播放速度；戰鬥中也可以切換。,Playback speed when a battle starts; you can change it during battle too.
sd_set_confirm,同機雙人輪流落子時，點一下先預覽、再點一次才落子，避免手滑。擺下的兵仍然不能收回。,"In alternate-placement duels, the first tap previews and the second places, to prevent misclicks. Placed units still can't be taken back."
sd_set_playtest,把每場的結果記在這台電腦（不上傳），方便回報問題。,Record each battle's result on this computer (never uploaded) to help with bug reports.
sd_set_cb,藍紅改成高對比色，並在圖表加上斜線紋和形狀標記。,"High-contrast team colours, plus hatching and shape markers on charts."
sd_set_shake,重擊時畫面震動。,Screen shake on heavy hits.
sd_set_slowmo,勝負關鍵的最後時刻放慢。,Slow motion during the final moments.
sd_set_flash,被打到時閃白。,White flash when units are hit.
report_by_type,各兵種合計,Totals by unit type
lb_has_locked,卡池有這個版本沒有的兵：%s（到卡池分頁拿掉）,"The pool has units not in this version: %s (remove them on the Unit pool tab)"
rule_short_snake5,輪流落子・每人 5 手,Alternating · 5 turns
rule_short_cap10,輪流・每手 10 金,Alternating · 10g/turn
