lb_full_duel,全場輪流落子,Full-field alternating deployment
lbd_t_deploy,部署方式,Deployment
lbd_deploy,自由：兵可以放在任何位置，按住左鍵滑動一次排一排，右鍵滑過擦掉；兵之間保持最小間距。格子：一格一隻（舊玩法）。,"Free: place anywhere — hold and drag to paint a row, right-drag to erase; units keep a minimum spacing. Grid: one unit per cell (classic)."
lbd_t_spacing,最小間距,Min spacing
lbd_spacing,兩隻兵中心最近可以多近。越小陣型可以越密，範圍傷害（投彈兵）也越痛。,How close two units' centres may be. Smaller means denser formations — and splash damage hurts more.
lbd_t_depth,部署縱深,Deploy depth
lbd_depth,可以擺到離自己底線多遠。越深兩軍越近，弓手先射的時間越短。,How far from your back line you may deploy. Deeper means the armies start closer and archers get fewer free volleys.
lbd_t_fullfield,全場,Full field
lbd_fullfield,對 AI：AI 先在自己半場擺好並公開，你可以擺在全場任何地方（離敵兵 1.5 格外），包圍、繞後。雙人：兩人輪流在全場落子，沒位置會自動跳過。,vs AI: the AI deploys on its half first and is revealed; you may place anywhere at least 1.5 cells from enemies. Duel: both players take turns across the whole field; a player with no room is skipped.
lb_deploy_short_grid,格子,Grid
lb_deploy_short_free,自由,Free
lb_sum_free,自由排兵,Free placement
lb_sum_full,全場,Full field
save_locked,這份存檔來自比較新的版本。為了保護它，這次遊玩的進度不會儲存；請更新遊戲。,"This save comes from a newer version. To protect it, progress won't be saved this session. Please update the game."
save_from_backup,主存檔損毀，已從備份還原；壞掉的檔案保留在存檔資料夾。,The main save was damaged and has been restored from backup. The damaged file is kept in the save folder.
set_reduce_fx,簡化特效,Reduce effects
sd_set_reduce_fx,一次關掉震動、閃白、慢動作，並減少粒子。,"Turns off shake, flash and slow motion, and cuts down on particles."
