intro_btn,自由排兵入門,Free placement basics
intro_s1,按住左鍵拖曳，畫出一排兵。先畫 4 隻以上。,Hold the left button and drag to draw a line of units. Place at least 4.
intro_s2,按住已經擺好的兵，可以把它搬到別的位置。,Press and hold a placed unit to move it somewhere else.
intro_s3,擺好了就按開戰。一開戰就不能再動，敵軍這時才會現身。,Press Battle when you're ready. You can't change anything after that — and only then will you see the enemy.
place_hint_lock,按下開戰後就不能再動。敵軍陣型要開戰才看得到。,You can't change anything once the battle starts. You'll only see the enemy's army then.
