blurb_10,奇襲兵：不會動，周圍毒傷並減速（要配主力）,Raider: can't move; poisons and slows nearby enemies (needs a main force)
blurb_11,奇襲兵：衝進敵陣自爆；半路被打死會連友軍一起炸,"Raider: charges in and explodes; shot down early, it hurts allies too"
blurb_12,奇襲兵：偽裝不被鎖定，敵人靠近就咬一大口並回血,Raider: disguised and untargeted; bites hard and heals when enemies come close
blurb_13,死掉裂成 2 隻小史萊姆，適合放前排,Splits into 2 slimelets on death; good up front
blurb_14,穿過所有兵直奔後排；箭和火罐無效，怕近戰,Passes through everything to reach the back line; immune to arrows and fire pots; weak to melee
blurb_15,綁定正前方的敵人，受的傷分一半給對方,Binds the enemy straight ahead and passes it half the damage it takes
blurb_16,每場一次：友軍殘血時定住周圍敵人，友軍減傷,"Once per battle: when allies are hurt, freezes nearby enemies and shields allies"
blurb_17,後排法師，把友軍屍體變成骷髏；翻盤用,Back-line caster; raises fallen allies as skeletons to turn the tide
blurb_18,把周圍所有敵人拉到自己身邊，和投彈兵、爆爆羊是搭檔,Pulls all nearby enemies to itself; pairs with bombers and Boom Sheep
blurb_19,巨大又慢，拍地造成傷害並擊退；死後留下碎石減速區,"Huge and slow; stomps deal damage and knock enemies back; leaves slowing rubble when it falls"
