map_d_river,中央是河，只能走兩座橋；箭和幽靈飛得過去,A river down the middle with two bridges. Arrows and ghosts cross freely.
map_d_forest,樹叢分出多條路，中間泥塘很慢,"Trees split the field into paths, with a slow mud pond in the middle."
map_d_ice,中央冰面快、上下雪地慢，碎冰逼人繞路,"Fast ice in the centre, slow snow on the edges, broken ice in the way."
map_d_lava,岩塊和熔岩分割戰場，中央灰燼很慢,"Rocks and lava split the field, with slow ash in the centre."
map_d_canyon,兩座大崖分三線：上下快而遠，中間慢而近,"Two cliffs make three lanes: long and fast, or short and slow."
