 succeeded in 48ms:
lbd_carry｜Unspent gold rolls over to your next turn. Save now, spend later — your opponent can see it too.
lbd_t_ai_level｜AI difficulty
lbd_ai_level｜Easy: places loosely. Normal: uses common formations. Hard: reads your last formation and counters it.
lbd_t_keep｜Keep formation
lbd_keep｜Start each new round with your previous formation.
lbd_t_ai_pool_same｜AI pool
lbd_ai_pool_same｜Turn off to give the AI its own pool on the Unit pool tab.
lbd_t_pool｜Unit pool
lbd_pool｜Which units can be used, up to 10 types. At least one fighter type is required; support units and raiders (Sporecap, Boom Sheep, Mimic) do not count.
lbd_t_lab｜Sandbox
lbd_lab｜Scale a unit's health, attack and speed from 50% to 200%, or turn skills off. Sandbox games don't count for stats or achievements.
lb_pinfo_standard｜The recommended setup: 10 Kingdom units, 100 gold, best of 3. Fully balance-tested.
lb_pinfo_classic5｜Only the first five units. The simplest game, and the only setup verified fair for two players.
lb_pinfo_small｜Little gold and a short clock: every unit counts and a game is over in under a minute.
lb_pinfo_big｜180 gold, up to 40 units, 120 seconds. The biggest, longest battles.
lb_pinfo_single｜One fighter type (plus one support if you like): pure positioning. Change the type on the Unit pool tab.
lb_pinfo_custom｜Custom rules. The differences from standard are listed on the right.
