sd_set_speed｜Playback speed when a battle starts; you can change it during battle too.
sd_set_confirm｜In alternate-placement duels, the first tap previews and the second places, to prevent misclicks. Placed units still can't be taken back.
sd_set_playtest｜Record each battle's result on this computer (never uploaded) to help with bug reports.
