lbd_deploy｜Free: place anywhere — hold and drag to paint a row, right-drag to erase; units keep a minimum spacing. Grid: one unit per cell (classic).
lbd_t_spacing｜Min spacing
lbd_spacing｜How close two units' centres may be. Smaller means denser formations — and splash damage hurts more.
lbd_t_depth｜Deploy depth
lbd_depth｜How far from your back line you may deploy. Deeper means the armies start closer and archers get fewer free volleys.
lbd_t_fullfield｜Full field
lbd_fullfield｜vs AI: the AI deploys on its half first and is revealed; you may place anywhere at least 1.5 cells from enemies. Duel: both players take turns across the whole field; a player with no room is skipped.
